Advanced DevSecOps - Scaling Security in Agile and CI/CD
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

• Understand the fundamentals of DevSecOps and its integration with Agile methodologies • Write secure user stories following security best practices • Install and configure Wiki.js for documentation management • Create and configure Jenkins CI/CD pipelines • Integrate Jenkins with Prometheus for monitoring • Visualize pipeline metrics and logs using Grafana • Implement a complete DevSecOps monitoring stack using open-source tools

Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

• Basic understanding of Linux command line operations • Familiarity with Git version control concepts • Basic knowledge of web applications and APIs • Understanding of containerization concepts (Docker basics) • Basic knowledge of YAML syntax • Familiarity with CI/CD concepts

